    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      144.0,
      310.14,
      412.99,
      322.14
    ],
    "text": "(hereinafter referred to as \"the tax\") shall be charged \u2010",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      144.0,
      344.16,
      542.71,
      356.16
    ],
    "text": "(a) at the time of supply, on every taxable supply of goods or services, made",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      180.0,
      366.12,
      542.71,
      378.12
    ],
    "text": "in a taxable period, by a registered person in the course of the carrying",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      180.0,
      388.02,
      497.41,
      400.02
    ],
    "text": "on, carrying out, of a taxable activity by such person in Sri Lanka;",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      422.04,
      465.49,
      434.04
    ],
    "text": "(b) on the importation of goods into Sri Lanka, by any person,",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      456.0,
      522.37,
      468.0
    ],
    "text": "and on the value of such goods or services supplied or the goods imported\u2026\"",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      490.02,
      542.71,
      502.02
    ],
    "text": "The learned counsel for the Petitioner contends that disposal of a building, motor vehicles and",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      511.98,
      542.71,
      523.98
    ],
    "text": "machinery cannot be liable for VAT if such disposal does not constitute a taxable activity and",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      533.94,
      542.71,
      545.94
    ],
    "text": "submits that the disposal of a building, motor vehicles and machinery by the Petitioner is not",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      555.9,
      389.77,
      567.9
    ],
    "text": "taxable activity within the meaning of section 83 of the VAT Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      589.86,
      542.71,
      601.86
    ],
    "text": "The Petitioner relies on extracts from Grainger & Son v. Gough (3 TC 462 at 472), Lionel",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri-Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      611.88,
      542.71,
      623.88
    ],
    "text": "Simmons Properties Ltd. (In Liquidation) and Others v. Commissioners of Inland Revenue (53 TC",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri-Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      633.84,
      542.71,
      645.84
    ],
    "text": "461 at 491\u20102) and Edwards (H.M. Inspector of Taxes) v. Bairstow & Harrison (36 TC 207) which",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri-Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      655.8,
      542.71,
      667.8
    ],
    "text": "discusses the interpretation of the words \"trade\", \"business\" and \"adventure in the nature of",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      677.82,
      542.71,
      689.82
    ],
    "text": "trade\". All these words appear as part of the definition of \"taxable activity\" in section 83 of the",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      699.72,
      118.81,
      711.72
    ],
    "text": "VAT Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      731.33,
      542.48,
      755.74
    ],
    "text": "Page 6 of 9",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri-Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.979999542236328
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      74.4,
      542.71,
      86.4
    ],
    "text": "However, I am not inclined to accept the position that for the disposal of a building, motor",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      96.36,
      542.71,
      108.36
    ],
    "text": "vehicles and machinery by the Petitioner to be liable for VAT, it must fulfill the requirements in",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      118.26,
      429.73,
      130.26
    ],
    "text": "the definition of the word \"taxable activity\" in section 83 of the VAT Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      152.28,
      542.71,
      164.28
    ],
    "text": "The taxable activity which the Petitioner carries on is manufacture and sale of load cells and",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      174.3,
      542.71,
      186.3
    ],
    "text": "accessories for electronic scale. In order for the disposal of a building, motor vehicles and",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      196.26,
      542.71,
      208.26
    ],
    "text": "machinery to be subject to VAT, there is no need for those acts i.e. disposal of a building,",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      218.22,
      542.71,
      230.22
    ],
    "text": "motor vehicles and machinery to be a taxable activity by itself within the meaning the word",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      240.18,
      542.71,
      252.18
    ],
    "text": "\"taxable activity\" in section 83 of the VAT Act. It suffices that the disposal of a building, motor",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      262.2,
      542.71,
      274.2
    ],
    "text": "vehicles and machinery was made by the Petitioner \"in the course of carrying on, or carrying",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri-Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      284.1,
      197.41,
      296.1
    ],
    "text": "out of a taxable activity\".",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri-Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      318.12,
      289.99,
      330.12
    ],
    "text": "In the course of carrying on, or carrying out",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri-BoldItalic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      352.08,
      542.71,
      364.08
    ],
    "text": "Manufacture and sale of load cells and accessories for electronic scale is the taxable activity of",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri-Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      374.1,
      542.71,
      386.1
    ],
    "text": "the Petitioner. The learned counsel for the Petitioner submits that although the Petitioner also",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      396.06,
      542.71,
      408.06
    ],
    "text": "owns capital assets such as buildings, motor vehicles and machinery which are capital assets",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      418.02,
      542.71,
      430.02
    ],
    "text": "used in the business, disposal of such capital assets are not liable to VAT as that is not supplies",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      439.92,
      519.37,
      451.92
    ],
    "text": "made by the Petitioner \"in the course of the carrying on, carrying out, of a taxable activity.\"",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri-Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      473.94,
      542.71,
      485.94
    ],
    "text": "The learned counsel for the Petitioner sought to draw an analogy with section 2(2) of the",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      495.9,
      336.07,
      507.9
    ],
    "text": "Finance Act 1972 of the United Kingdom which reads:",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      529.86,
      465.19,
      541.86
    ],
    "text": "\"Tax on the supplies of goods and services shall be charged only where: \u2010",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      563.88,
      313.33,
      575.88
    ],
    "text": "(a) the supply is a taxable supply; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      108.0,
      597.84,
      542.71,
      609.84
    ],
    "text": "(b) the goods or services are services by a taxable person in the course of a business",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri-Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      144.0,
      619.74,
      409.87,
      631.74
    ],
    "text": "carried on by him\" (Emphasis added by the Petitioner)",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri-Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      731.33,
      542.48,
      755.74
    ],
    "text": "Page 7 of 9",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri-Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.979999542236328
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      74.4,
      542.71,
      86.4
    ],
    "text": "He then pointed out that section 2(2) of the Finance Act 1972 of the United Kingdom was",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      96.36,
      542.71,
      108.36
    ],
    "text": "amended in 1977 by the introduction of the words \"or furtherance\" and that the amended",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      118.26,
      419.89,
      130.26
    ],
    "text": "section 2(2) of the Finance Act 1972 of the United Kingdom now reads:",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      108.0,
      152.28,
      542.71,
      164.28
    ],
    "text": "\"Tax shall be charged on any supply of goods or services made in the United Kingdom,",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      108.0,
      174.3,
      542.71,
      186.3
    ],
    "text": "where it is a taxable supply made by a taxable person in the course or furtherance of",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri-Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      108.0,
      196.2,
      439.51,
      208.2
    ],
    "text": "any business carried on by him\" (Emphasis added by the Petitioner)",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      230.22,
      542.71,
      242.22
    ],
    "text": "The learned counsel for the Petitioner drew the attention of Court to the decision in Roderick",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri-Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      252.18,
      542.71,
      264.18
    ],
    "text": "W.K. Stirling v. Commissioner of Customs and Excise [(1986) 2 CMLR 117] where it was observed",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri-Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      274.14,
      164.17,
      286.14
    ],
    "text": "(at page 121\u2010122):",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      108.0,
      308.16,
      542.71,
      320.16
    ],
    "text": "\"In our opinion, the 1977 Act when it added the words 'or furtherance of' any business",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      108.0,
      330.12,
      542.71,
      342.12
    ],
    "text": "to section 2(2) of the Finance Act 1972 did not intend, in defiance of the Sixth Directive,",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      108.0,
      352.08,
      542.71,
      364.08
    ],
    "text": "to extend the ambit of value added tax to supplies made by a taxable person who was",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      108.0,
      374.1,
      542.71,
      386.1
    ],
    "text": "not acting as such and was not carrying out an economic activity in terms of Article 4. In",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri-Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      108.0,
      396.06,
      542.71,
      408.06
    ],
    "text": "our opinion the purpose of the 1977 Act in adding the words 'or furtherance' was to",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri-Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      108.0,
      418.02,
      542.71,
      430.02
    ],
    "text": "ensure that all business activities were caught by the section, for example, fringe",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri-Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      108.0,
      439.98,
      542.71,
      451.98
    ],
    "text": "activities carried on separately from a main business; or transactions related in some",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri-Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      108.0,
      461.94,
      542.71,
      473.94
    ],
    "text": "way to the main business but which are different in character from the general run of",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri-Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      108.0,
      483.9,
      523.33,
      495.9
    ],
    "text": "business, as where a retailer sells a delivery van\" (Emphasis added by the Petitioner).",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri-Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      517.86,
      542.71,
      529.86
    ],
    "text": "The learned Counsel for the Petitioner therefore submitted that \"fringe activities carried on",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      539.88,
      542.71,
      551.88
    ],
    "text": "separately from a main business\" such as where a retailer sells a delivery van became subject to",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      561.78,
      354.19,
      573.78
    ],
    "text": "VAT in UK only because of the words \"or furtherance of\".",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri-Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      595.8,
      542.71,
      607.8
    ],
    "text": "He further submitted that the words in the course of a business carried on by him in section 2(2)",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri-Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      617.82,
      542.71,
      629.82
    ],
    "text": "of the Finance Act 1972 of the United Kingdom are similar to the wording in the course of the",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri-Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      639.78,
      542.71,
      651.78
    ],
    "text": "carrying on, carrying out, of a taxable activity in section 2(1)(a) of the VAT Act and contended",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri-Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      661.74,
      542.71,
      673.74
    ],
    "text": "that Court should adopt the approach taken in Roderick W.K. Stirling v. Commissioner of",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri-Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      683.64,
      209.59,
      695.64
    ],
    "text": "Customs and Excise (supra).",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri-Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 7,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      731.33,
      542.48,
      755.74
    ],
    "text": "Page 8 of 9",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri-Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.979999542236328
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 7,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      74.4,
      542.71,
      86.4
    ],
    "text": "However, in my view the technique followed by the drafters of the English Act and the VAT Act",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 7,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      96.36,
      542.71,
      108.36
    ],
    "text": "may not be the same. For example, the goods and services tax are imposed by the Finance Act",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 7,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      118.32,
      542.71,
      130.32
    ],
    "text": "1972 of the United Kingdom by reference to business whereas in Sri Lanka the VAT is imposed",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri-Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 7,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      140.34,
      542.71,
      152.34
    ],
    "text": "by the VAT Act by reference to taxable activity. In section 83 of the VAT Act, the definition of",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri-Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 7,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      162.3,
      542.71,
      174.3
    ],
    "text": "\"taxable activity\" is not limited to \"business\" but includes \"trade\" and \"adventure in the nature",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 7,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      184.26,
      542.71,
      196.26
    ],
    "text": "of trade\". Hence it is unsafe to draw the analogy proposed by the learned counsel for the",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 7,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      206.16,
      128.95,
      218.16
    ],
    "text": "Petitioner.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 7,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      240.18,
      542.71,
      252.18
    ],
    "text": "In Croos Raja Chandra v. Commissioner of Inland Revenue (76 N.L.R. 102 at 104) Weeramantry J.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri-Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 7,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      262.2,
      542.71,
      274.2
    ],
    "text": "held that no doubt the words \"in the course of\" may in certain contexts be given a somewhat",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 7,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      284.16,
      542.71,
      296.16
    ],
    "text": "liberal interpretation so as to gather in matters not literally occurring \"in the course of\" the",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 7,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      306.12,
      542.71,
      318.12
    ],
    "text": "object or proceeding to which the words relate. In my view, VAT liability may arise in terms of",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 7,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      328.08,
      542.71,
      340.08
    ],
    "text": "the VAT Act, where there is some visible connection existing between the taxable activity and",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 7,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      350.04,
      238.51,
      362.04
    ],
    "text": "the supply of goods and services.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 7,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      384.0,
      542.71,
      396.0
    ],
    "text": "I am unable to agree with the contention of the learned counsel for the Petitioner that the sale",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 7,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      406.02,
      542.71,
      418.02
    ],
    "text": "by the Petitioner of its capital assets such as buildings, motor vehicles and machinery are not",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 7,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      427.98,
      542.71,
      439.98
    ],
    "text": "part of its business and therefore not liable to VAT as that is not supplies made by the",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 7,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      449.88,
      458.23,
      461.88
    ],
    "text": "Petitioner \"in the course of the carrying on, carrying out, of a taxable activity\".",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri-Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 7,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      483.9,
      542.71,
      495.9
    ],
    "text": "As the TAC correctly held, the sale of capital assets is taking place within the framework of the",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 7,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      505.92,
      542.71,
      517.92
    ],
    "text": "business of the Petitioner. The capital assets used are an integral part of the business of the",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri-Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 7,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      527.88,
      542.71,
      539.88
    ],
    "text": "Petitioner. This fact is admitted by none other than the representative of the Petitioner in P6",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 7,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      549.84,
      542.71,
      561.84
    ],
    "text": "where it is stated that I do not think that there is a dispute about the fact that these items are",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri-Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 7,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      571.8,
      542.71,
      583.8
    ],
    "text": "capital assets used in the business of the Appellant Company. This was reiterated by the",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri-Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 7,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      593.76,
      318.97,
      605.76
    ],
    "text": "representative of the Petitioner to the TAC in P14.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 8,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      731.33,
      542.48,
      755.74
    ],
    "text": "Page 9 of 9",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri-Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.979999542236328
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 8,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      74.4,
      542.71,
      86.4
    ],
    "text": "Therefore, in my view the TAC correctly concluded that the capital assets used are an integral",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 8,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      96.36,
      542.71,
      108.36
    ],
    "text": "part of the business of the Petitioner and the sale of such capital assets are taxable supplies",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri-Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 8,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      118.32,
      542.71,
      130.32
    ],
    "text": "which are taking place within the business itself and cannot be separated or isolated from the",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 8,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      140.34,
      542.71,
      152.34
    ],
    "text": "business of the Petitioner. Thus, they were supplies made by the Petitioner \"in the course of the",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri-Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 8,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      162.24,
      306.25,
      174.24
    ],
    "text": "carrying on, carrying out, of a taxable activity\".",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri-Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 8,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      196.26,
      542.71,
      208.26
    ],
    "text": "The Court need not address the other two issues raised by the Petitioner in view of the",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 8,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      218.16,
      203.59,
      230.16
    ],
    "text": "conclusions set out above.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 8,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      252.18,
      410.89,
      264.18
    ],
    "text": "For all the foregoing reasons, the application is dismissed with costs.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 8,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      354.12,
      465.85,
      366.12
    ],
    "text": "Judge of the Court of Appeal",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 8,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      388.08,
      213.37,
      400.08
    ],
    "text": "N. Bandula Karunarathna J.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri-Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 8,
    "bbox": [
      72.0,
      456.0,
      291.01,
      468.0
    ],
    "text": "I agree.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
